<div class="intro">
  <h2 class="en">How this works</h2>
  <h2 class="hr">Kako funkcionira</h2>
  <p class="en">Your VM is set up with pre-conditions for all 10 tasks. Connect via SSH using the same port and password as your previous exams.</p>
  <p class="hr">Vaš VM je postavljen s preduvjetima za svih 10 zadataka. Povežite se putem SSH-a koristeći isti port i lozinku kao za prethodne ispite.</p>
  <p>
    <code>grade</code> &mdash; <span class="en">check all tasks at once</span><span class="hr">provjeri sve zadatke odjednom</span><br>
    <code>grade t3</code> &mdash; <span class="en">check a single task</span><span class="hr">provjeri jedan zadatak</span><br>
    <code>grade reset t3</code> &mdash; <span class="en">wipe task 3 back to start state and retry</span><span class="hr">resetiraj zadatak 3 i pokušaj ponovo</span><br>
    <code>grade reset all</code> &mdash; <span class="en">wipe all tasks (full reset)</span><span class="hr">resetiraj sve zadatke (potpuni reset)</span><br>
    <code>cat ~/practice-tasks.txt</code> &mdash; <span class="en">read the full task sheet in terminal</span><span class="hr">pročitaj sve zadatke u terminalu</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <span class="en">Tasks T1&ndash;T5 cover <strong>RH124</strong> material. Tasks T6&ndash;T10 cover <strong>RH134</strong> material.</span>
    <span class="hr">Zadaci T1&ndash;T5 pokrivaju <strong>RH124</strong> gradivo. Zadaci T6&ndash;T10 pokrivaju <strong>RH134</strong> gradivo.</span>
  </p>
  <div class="note">
    <strong class="en">Tasks requiring a reboot to verify persistence: T4, T7, T8, T10.</strong>
    <strong class="hr">Zadaci koji zahtijevaju ponovljeno pokretanje za provjeru trajnosti: T4, T7, T8, T10.</strong>
    <span class="en">Plan one reboot near the end of your session after completing those tasks. After rebooting, reconnect and run <code>grade</code> again.</span>
    <span class="hr">Planirajte jedno pokretanje pri kraju sesije, nakon završetka tih zadataka. Nakon ponovnog pokretanja, povežite se i pokrenite <code>grade</code> ponovo.</span>
  </div>
</div>


<div class="section-label">
  <span class="en">RH124 Topics &mdash; Tasks 1&ndash;5</span>
  <span class="hr">Teme RH124 &mdash; Zadaci 1&ndash;5</span>
</div>

<!-- TASK 1 -->
<div class="task rh124-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 1 &mdash; File and Directory Management</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 1 &mdash; Upravljanje datotekama i direktorijima</span>
    <span class="task-meta">15 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~12 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Easy</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">Organise project files for the IT department.</p>
  <p class="hr">Organizirajte projektne datoteke za IT odjel.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create the directory <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files</code> (with all intermediate directories). <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite direktorij <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files</code> (s međudirektorijima). <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Inside it, create three empty files: <code>notes.txt</code>, <code>report.txt</code>, <code>archive.txt</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Unutar njega stvorite tri prazne datoteke: <code>notes.txt</code>, <code>report.txt</code>, <code>archive.txt</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Copy <code>/etc/hostname</code> to <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files/hostname.txt</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Kopirajte <code>/etc/hostname</code> u <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files/hostname.txt</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Append the last 5 lines of <code>/etc/passwd</code> to <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files/report.txt</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Dodajte zadnjih 5 redaka datoteke <code>/etc/passwd</code> na kraj <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files/report.txt</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create a <strong>hard link</strong> to <code>report.txt</code> at <code>/home/student/projects/report-hardlink</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite <strong>tvrdu vezu</strong> (hard link) na <code>report.txt</code> na putanji <code>/home/student/projects/report-hardlink</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create a <strong>symbolic link</strong> to <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files</code> at <code>/home/student/lab-shortcut</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite <strong>simboličku vezu</strong> (symlink) na <code>/home/student/projects/lab-files</code> na putanji <code>/home/student/lab-shortcut</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <span class="en"><code>mkdir -p</code> creates all missing intermediate directories. Hard links (<code>ln</code>) and
    soft links (<code>ln -s</code>) are different &mdash; a hard link points to the same inode; a symbolic link
    stores a path string.</span>
    <span class="hr"><code>mkdir -p</code> kreira sve nedostajuće međudirektorije. Tvrda veza (<code>ln</code>) i simbolička
    veza (<code>ln -s</code>) su različite &mdash; tvrda veza pokazuje na isti inode; simbolička veza pohranjuje
    niz znakova putanje.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TASK 2 -->
<div class="task rh124-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 2 &mdash; Users, Groups, and Password Policy</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 2 &mdash; Korisnici, grupe i politika lozinki</span>
    <span class="task-meta">20 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~15 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Easy&ndash;Medium</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">Provision an account for a new operations team member. The <code>ops</code> group (GID 50100) already exists &mdash; do not recreate it.</p>
  <p class="hr">Pripremate korisnički račun za novog člana operativnog tima. Grupa <code>ops</code> (GID 50100) već postoji &mdash; nemojte je ponovno stvarati.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create a user named <code>sysadmin1</code> with <code>ops</code> as a supplementary group. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite korisnika <code>sysadmin1</code> s <code>ops</code> kao dopunskom grupom. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Set the initial password to <code>Welcome1</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Postavite početnu lozinku na <code>Welcome1</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Force a password change on first login. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Prisilite promjenu lozinke pri prvoj prijavi. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Set the password policy for <code>sysadmin1</code>: <span class="pts">(6 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Postavite politiku lozinki za <code>sysadmin1</code>: <span class="pts">(6 pts)</span></span>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="en">Minimum days between password changes: <code>7</code></span><span class="hr">Minimalan broj dana između promjena lozinke: <code>7</code></span></li>
        <li><span class="en">Maximum days before password change required: <code>90</code></span><span class="hr">Maksimalan broj dana prije obvezne promjene: <code>90</code></span></li>
        <li><span class="en">Account expiry date: <code>2027-06-30</code></span><span class="hr">Datum isteka računa: <code>2027-06-30</code></span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Allow <code>sysadmin1</code> to run any command with <code>sudo</code> without a password prompt. Use a dedicated file in <code>/etc/sudoers.d/</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Dopustite korisniku <code>sysadmin1</code> pokretanje bilo koje naredbe putem <code>sudo</code> bez upita za lozinku. Koristite namjensku datoteku u <code>/etc/sudoers.d/</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <code>useradd -G ops sysadmin1</code> &mdash; <span class="en">adds the supplementary group.</span><span class="hr">dodaje dopunsku grupu.</span><br>
    <code>chage -d 0</code> &mdash; <span class="en">forces change on next login.</span><span class="hr">prisiljava promjenu pri prvoj prijavi.</span>
    <code>chage -m 7 -M 90 -E 2027-06-30</code> &mdash; <span class="en">sets the policy.</span><span class="hr">postavlja politiku.</span><br>
    <span class="en">Sudoers line:</span><span class="hr">Redak u sudoers:</span> <code>sysadmin1 ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL</code>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TASK 3 -->
<div class="task rh124-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 3 &mdash; File Permissions and Collaborative Directory</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 3 &mdash; Dozvole datoteka i zajednički direktorij</span>
    <span class="task-meta">20 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~15 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Medium</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">Configure a shared workspace for the ops team.</p>
  <p class="hr">Konfigurirajte zajednički radni prostor za operativni tim.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create the directory <code>/home/ops-workspace</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite direktorij <code>/home/ops-workspace</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Set the group owner to <code>ops</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Postavite vlasnika grupe na <code>ops</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Set permissions so that: owner has <code>rwx</code>, group has <code>rwx</code>, others have no access (<code>---</code>). <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Postavite dozvole tako da: vlasnik ima <code>rwx</code>, grupa ima <code>rwx</code>, ostali nemaju pristup (<code>---</code>). <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Set the <strong>SGID bit</strong> so that new files inherit the <code>ops</code> group automatically. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Postavite <strong>SGID bit</strong> kako bi nove datoteke automatski naslijedile grupu <code>ops</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Set the <strong>sticky bit</strong> so users can only delete their own files. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Postavite <strong>sticky bit</strong> kako bi korisnici mogli brisati samo vlastite datoteke. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Configure <code>sysadmin1</code>'s shell so that <code>umask</code> is persistently set to <code>007</code> (in <code>~/.bashrc</code> or <code>~/.bash_profile</code>). <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Konfigurirajte ljusku korisnika <code>sysadmin1</code> tako da <code>umask</code> bude trajno postavljen na <code>007</code> (u <code>~/.bashrc</code> ili <code>~/.bash_profile</code>). <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <span class="en">Expected final permissions: <code>drwxrws--T</code>.
    <code>chmod 3770 /home/ops-workspace</code> sets this in one shot (SGID=2000, sticky=1000).
    Append <code>umask 007</code> to <code>/home/sysadmin1/.bashrc</code>.</span>
    <span class="hr">Očekivane završne dozvole: <code>drwxrws--T</code>.
    <code>chmod 3770 /home/ops-workspace</code> postavlja ovo odjednom (SGID=2000, sticky=1000).
    Dodajte <code>umask 007</code> u <code>/home/sysadmin1/.bashrc</code>.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TASK 4 -->
<div class="task rh124-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 4 &mdash; Service Management</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 4 &mdash; Upravljanje uslugama</span>
    <span class="task-meta">15 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~10 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Easy</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">The system services are in a non-default state. Fix them and verify persistence across a reboot.</p>
  <p class="hr">Sistemske usluge su u nestandardnom stanju. Ispravite ih i provjerite trajnost kroz ponovljeno pokretanje.</p>
  <p>
    <span class="en">Current state (set at provisioning):</span><span class="hr">Trenutno stanje (postavljeno pri inicijalizaciji):</span>
    <code>crond</code> &mdash; <span class="en">stopped, disabled</span><span class="hr">zaustavljeno, onemogućeno</span>
    &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <code>rsyslog</code> &mdash; <span class="en">stopped, disabled</span><span class="hr">zaustavljeno, onemogućeno</span>
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Start <code>crond</code> and enable it so it starts automatically at boot. <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Pokrenite <code>crond</code> i omogućite ga da se pokreće automatski pri paljenju. <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Start <code>rsyslog</code> and enable it so it starts automatically at boot. <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Pokrenite <code>rsyslog</code> i omogućite ga da se pokreće automatski pri paljenju. <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Reboot the VM to verify both services come up on their own: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code><br>
        Then reconnect and run: <code>grade t4</code> <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Ponovno pokrenite VM za provjeru: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code><br>
        Zatim se povežite i pokrenite: <code>grade t4</code> <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <code>systemctl enable --now &lt;service&gt;</code> &mdash;
    <span class="en">starts it immediately and marks it to start at boot in one command.</span>
    <span class="hr">pokreće odmah i postavlja pokretanje pri paljenju jednom naredbom.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TASK 5 -->
<div class="task rh124-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 5 &mdash; DNF Repository and Package Management</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 5 &mdash; DNF repozitorij i upravljanje paketima</span>
    <span class="task-meta">15 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~10 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Easy</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">Configure your system to use the local practice repository and manage packages.</p>
  <p class="hr">Konfigurirajte sustav da koristi lokalni repozitorij za vježbu i upravljajte paketima.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create <code>/etc/yum.repos.d/practice.repo</code>: <span class="pts">(6 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite <code>/etc/yum.repos.d/practice.repo</code>: <span class="pts">(6 pts)</span></span>
      <ul>
        <li><code>baseurl=http://172.16.16.121/repo</code></li>
        <li><code>enabled=1</code></li>
        <li><code>gpgcheck=0</code></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Install <code>vim-enhanced</code> from the repo. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Instalirajte <code>vim-enhanced</code> iz repozitorija. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Install <code>wget</code> from the repo. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Instalirajte <code>wget</code> iz repozitorija. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Remove the pre-installed <code>zip</code> package. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Uklonite unaprijed instalirani paket <code>zip</code>. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <code>dnf install vim-enhanced wget</code> &mdash; <span class="en">installs both at once.</span><span class="hr">instalira oba odjednom.</span><br>
    <code>dnf remove zip</code> &mdash; <span class="en">removes it.</span><span class="hr">uklanja ga.</span>
    <code>rpm -q &lt;pkg&gt;</code> &mdash; <span class="en">checks if installed.</span><span class="hr">provjerava je li instaliran.</span>
  </div>
</div>


<div class="section-label">
  <span class="en">RH134 Topics &mdash; Tasks 6&ndash;10</span>
  <span class="hr">Teme RH134 &mdash; Zadaci 6&ndash;10</span>
</div>

<!-- TASK 6 -->
<div class="task rh134-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 6 &mdash; Shell Scripting: Service Status Report</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 6 &mdash; Skriptiranje ljuske: izvještaj o stanju usluga</span>
    <span class="task-meta">15 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~12 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Easy</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">Write a script that reports the live status of system services.</p>
  <p class="hr">Napišite skriptu koja izvještava o trenutnom stanju sistemskih usluga.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create an executable script at <code>/home/student/bin/service-report.sh</code> with a proper shebang line. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite izvršnu skriptu na <code>/home/student/bin/service-report.sh</code> s ispravnom shebang linijom. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">The script must loop over these four service names: <code>sshd  crond  chronyd  rsyslog</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Skripta mora prolaziti kroz ova četiri naziva usluga: <code>sshd  crond  chronyd  rsyslog</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">For each service, print exactly one line in this format: <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span><br>
        <code>SERVICE: &lt;name&gt; ACTIVE: &lt;active|inactive&gt; ENABLED: &lt;enabled|disabled&gt;</code><br>
        Use <code>systemctl is-active</code> and <code>systemctl is-enabled</code> to get the values.</span>
      <span class="hr">Za svaku uslugu ispišite točno jedan redak u ovom formatu: <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span><br>
        <code>SERVICE: &lt;naziv&gt; ACTIVE: &lt;active|inactive&gt; ENABLED: &lt;enabled|disabled&gt;</code><br>
        Koristite <code>systemctl is-active</code> i <code>systemctl is-enabled</code> za dohvat vrijednosti.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Running the script must <strong>overwrite</strong> (not append) its output to <code>/home/student/reports/service-status.txt</code> &mdash; running it twice must not double the lines. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Pokretanje skripte mora <strong>prebrisati</strong> (ne dodati) izlaz u <code>/home/student/reports/service-status.txt</code> &mdash; dvostruko pokretanje ne smije udvostručiti retke. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <span class="en">Use command substitution: <code>ACTIVE=$(systemctl is-active sshd)</code>.
    To overwrite on every run, use <code>&gt;</code> (not <code>&gt;&gt;</code>) when writing the output file.
    Make it executable: <code>chmod +x /home/student/bin/service-report.sh</code></span>
    <span class="hr">Koristite supstituciju naredbi: <code>ACTIVE=$(systemctl is-active sshd)</code>.
    Za prebrisivanje pri svakom pokretanju koristite <code>&gt;</code> (ne <code>&gt;&gt;</code>) pri pisanju.
    Učinite skriptu izvršnom: <code>chmod +x /home/student/bin/service-report.sh</code></span>
  </div>
