<!-- TASK 7 -->
<div class="task rh134-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 7 &mdash; LVM: Build, Mount, and Extend Storage</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 7 &mdash; LVM: izgradnja, montiranje i proširenje pohrane</span>
    <span class="task-meta">20 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~20 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Medium</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">A raw, empty disk is attached to your VM alongside the OS disk. Turn it into a persistently-mounted LVM volume and then grow it.</p>
  <p class="hr">Prazan, sirovi disk je priključen na vaš VM uz OS disk. Pretvorite ga u trajno montirani LVM volumen i proširite ga.</p>
  <div class="note">
    <strong class="en">Do NOT hardcode <code>/dev/sda</code> or <code>/dev/sdb</code> in fstab.</strong>
    <strong class="hr">NEMOJTE tvrdo kodirati <code>/dev/sda</code> ili <code>/dev/sdb</code> u fstab.</strong>
    <span class="en">Both disks are on the same SCSI bus and the kernel can assign their letters in either order across reboots.
    Identify the empty disk with <code>lsblk</code> first, then use the stable LV device path
    (<code>/dev/vg_practice/lv_practice</code>) in fstab &mdash; not the raw <code>sd*</code> letter.</span>
    <span class="hr">Oba diska su na istoj SCSI sabirnici i jezgra može dodijeliti slova u bilo kojim redoslijedu.
    Prvo identificirajte prazan disk s <code>lsblk</code>, zatim koristite stabilnu LV putanju
    (<code>/dev/vg_practice/lv_practice</code>) u fstab &mdash; ne sirovo slovo <code>sd*</code>.</span>
  </div>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en"><strong>Identify the empty disk:</strong> run <code>lsblk</code> and find the disk with no partitions that is not the OS disk (the OS disk backs <code>/</code>). Note its name.</span>
      <span class="hr"><strong>Identificirajte prazan disk:</strong> pokrenite <code>lsblk</code> i pronađite disk bez particija koji nije OS disk (OS disk podupire <code>/</code>). Zapamtite njegovo ime.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Partition it for LVM use (one partition, LVM flag set). Create a physical volume and a volume group named <code>vg_practice</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Particionirajte ga za LVM (jedna particija, LVM oznaka). Stvorite fizički volumen i grupu volumena <code>vg_practice</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create a logical volume named <code>lv_practice</code> with initial size <code>300M</code>, format it XFS, and mount it persistently at <code>/storage/practice</code> using <code>/dev/vg_practice/lv_practice</code> in fstab (must survive reboot). <span class="pts">(7 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite logički volumen <code>lv_practice</code> veličine <code>300M</code>, formatirajte kao XFS i trajno montirajte na <code>/storage/practice</code> koristeći <code>/dev/vg_practice/lv_practice</code> u fstab (mora preživjeti pokretanje). <span class="pts">(7 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create <code>/storage/practice/marker.txt</code> containing the exact text: <code>practice volume ready</code> <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite <code>/storage/practice/marker.txt</code> s točnim sadržajem: <code>practice volume ready</code> <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Extend <code>lv_practice</code> by <code>500M</code> and grow the XFS filesystem to use the new space &mdash; without unmounting or losing the marker file. <span class="pts">(7 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Proširite <code>lv_practice</code> za <code>500M</code> i povećajte XFS datotečni sustav &mdash; bez odmontiranja ili gubitka marker datoteke. <span class="pts">(7 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="note">
    <span class="en">After step 3, reboot once near the end of your session: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code> &mdash; then run <code>grade t7</code> to verify persistence.</span>
    <span class="hr">Nakon koraka 3, restartajte pri kraju sesije: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code> &mdash; zatim pokrenite <code>grade t7</code> za provjeru trajnosti.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <code>lsblk -fp</code> &mdash; <span class="en">shows filesystem type and mountpoint &mdash; the empty disk has neither.</span><span class="hr">prikazuje vrstu sustava datoteka i točku montiranja &mdash; prazan disk nema ni jedno.</span><br>
    <code>parted &lt;disk&gt; mklabel gpt</code> &rarr; <code>mkpart primary 1MiB 100%</code> &rarr; <code>set 1 lvm on</code><br>
    <code>pvcreate &lt;disk&gt;1</code> &rarr; <code>vgcreate vg_practice &lt;disk&gt;1</code> &rarr; <code>lvcreate -L 300M -n lv_practice vg_practice</code><br>
    <span class="en"><code>/dev/vg_practice/lv_practice</code> is a stable path &mdash; safe to use directly in fstab.</span>
    <span class="hr"><code>/dev/vg_practice/lv_practice</code> je stabilna putanja &mdash; sigurno koristiti direktno u fstab.</span><br>
    <span class="en">After <code>lvextend</code>:</span><span class="hr">Nakon <code>lvextend</code>:</span> <code>xfs_growfs /storage/practice</code>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TASK 8 -->
<div class="task rh134-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 8 &mdash; Persistent Logging: journald + rsyslog</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 8 &mdash; Trajno bilježenje: journald + rsyslog</span>
    <span class="task-meta">15 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~12 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Easy&ndash;Medium</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">Configure two logging improvements.</p>
  <p class="hr">Konfigurirajte dva poboljšanja u bilježenju.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Configure <code>systemd-journald</code> to store logs persistently on disk (the journal is currently volatile). <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Konfigurirajte <code>systemd-journald</code> da trajno pohranjuje zapise na disk (journal je trenutno nestalan). <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create an rsyslog configuration file under <code>/etc/rsyslog.d/</code> that routes all messages matching facility <code>local3</code> at priority <code>warning</code> (and higher) to <code>/var/log/practice-events</code>. <span class="pts">(6 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite rsyslog konfiguracijsku datoteku u <code>/etc/rsyslog.d/</code> koja usmjerava sve poruke facility <code>local3</code> na razini <code>warning</code> (i više) u <code>/var/log/practice-events</code>. <span class="pts">(6 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Generate a test message: <code>logger -p local3.warning "test message"</code><br>
        Confirm it appears in <code>/var/log/practice-events</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Generirajte testnu poruku: <code>logger -p local3.warning "test message"</code><br>
        Potvrdite da se pojavljuje u <code>/var/log/practice-events</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="note">
    <span class="en">Reboot to verify the persistent journal survives: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code></span>
    <span class="hr">Restartajte za provjeru preživljavanja trajnog journala: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code></span>
  </div>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <span class="en">Persistent journald requires the directory <code>/var/log/journal/</code> to exist before restarting
    <code>systemd-journald</code>. Rsyslog routing syntax:
    <code>local3.warning&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/var/log/practice-events</code>
    Place the config file in <code>/etc/rsyslog.d/</code> and restart rsyslog.</span>
    <span class="hr">Trajna pohrana journald zahtijeva da direktorij <code>/var/log/journal/</code> postoji
    prije ponovnog pokretanja <code>systemd-journald</code>. Sintaksa rsyslog usmjeravanja:
    <code>local3.warning&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/var/log/practice-events</code>
    Smjestite konfiguracijsku datoteku u <code>/etc/rsyslog.d/</code> i restartajte rsyslog.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TASK 9 -->
<div class="task rh134-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 9 &mdash; SELinux: File Context and Boolean</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 9 &mdash; SELinux: kontekst datoteke i boolean</span>
    <span class="task-meta">15 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~12 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Medium</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">A web file has the wrong SELinux context and a required boolean is off. Fix both &mdash; persistently.</p>
  <p class="hr">Web datoteka ima pogrešan SELinux kontekst i potrebni boolean je isključen. Ispravite oboje &mdash; trajno.</p>
  <p>
    <span class="en">Current state:</span><span class="hr">Trenutno stanje:</span>
    <code>/var/www/html/practice.html</code> &mdash; <span class="en">SELinux type</span><span class="hr">SELinux tip</span> <code>var_t</code> (<span class="en">wrong</span><span class="hr">pogrešno</span>)
    &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <code>httpd_can_network_connect_db</code> <span class="en">boolean is off</span><span class="hr">boolean je isključen</span>
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Verify SELinux is in <code>Enforcing</code> mode. If it is not, set it back. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Provjerite da je SELinux u <code>Enforcing</code> modu. Ako nije, vratite ga. <span class="pts">(3 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Fix the SELinux context on <code>/var/www/html/practice.html</code> so it has type <code>httpd_sys_content_t</code>.
        The fix must be persistent &mdash; use <code>semanage fcontext</code> + <code>restorecon</code>
        (not <code>chcon</code> alone, which does not survive a relabel). <span class="pts">(8 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Ispravite SELinux kontekst na <code>/var/www/html/practice.html</code> da ima tip <code>httpd_sys_content_t</code>.
        Ispravak mora biti trajan &mdash; koristite <code>semanage fcontext</code> + <code>restorecon</code>
        (ne samo <code>chcon</code>, koji ne preživljava relabel). <span class="pts">(8 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Enable the <code>httpd_can_network_connect_db</code> boolean persistently. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Trajno omogućite boolean <code>httpd_can_network_connect_db</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <span class="en">Check context: <code>ls -Z /var/www/html/practice.html</code><br>
    Fix persistently:<br>
    <code>sudo semanage fcontext -a -t httpd_sys_content_t '/var/www/html/practice\.html'</code><br>
    <code>sudo restorecon -v /var/www/html/practice.html</code><br>
    Enable boolean: <code>sudo setsebool -P httpd_can_network_connect_db on</code></span>
    <span class="hr">Provjera konteksta: <code>ls -Z /var/www/html/practice.html</code><br>
    Trajni ispravak:<br>
    <code>sudo semanage fcontext -a -t httpd_sys_content_t '/var/www/html/practice\.html'</code><br>
    <code>sudo restorecon -v /var/www/html/practice.html</code><br>
    Omogući boolean: <code>sudo setsebool -P httpd_can_network_connect_db on</code></span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TASK 10 -->
<div class="task rh134-stripe">
  <div class="task-header">
    <span class="task-title en">Task 10 &mdash; Podman: Build, Run, and Persist a Container</span>
    <span class="task-title hr">Zadatak 10 &mdash; Podman: izgradnja, pokretanje i trajnost kontejnera</span>
    <span class="task-meta">15 pts &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ~15 min &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Medium</span>
  </div>
  <p class="en">Build a custom web container and keep it running after logout and reboot.</p>
  <p class="hr">Izgradite prilagođeni web kontejner i zadržite ga aktivnim i nakon odjave i ponovnog pokretanja.</p>
  <p><span class="en">Base image (pre-pulled, no internet needed):</span><span class="hr">Osnovna slika (unaprijed preuzeta, internet nije potreban):</span> <code>{{ practice_base_image }}</code></p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Create <code>/home/student/webapp/Containerfile</code> that starts from the base image above and writes <code>Practice web server</code> as the content of <code>/var/www/html/index.html</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Stvorite <code>/home/student/webapp/Containerfile</code> koji počinje od gornje osnovne slike i upisuje <code>Practice web server</code> kao sadržaj <code>/var/www/html/index.html</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Build the image and tag it as <code>practice-web:1.0</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Izgradite sliku i označite je kao <code>practice-web:1.0</code>. <span class="pts">(2 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Run the image as a detached container named <code>practice-srv</code>, mapping host port <code>8180</code> to the container's port <code>8080</code>. Verify: <code>curl localhost:8180</code> should return <code>Practice web server</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Pokrenite sliku kao odvojeni kontejner <code>practice-srv</code>, mapiranjem porta <code>8180</code> na port kontejnera <code>8080</code>. Provjera: <code>curl localhost:8180</code> treba vratiti <code>Practice web server</code>. <span class="pts">(4 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="en">Make the container persist across logout and reboot using a generated systemd unit, enabled for your user. <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
      <span class="hr">Učinite kontejner trajnim kroz odjavu i ponovljeno pokretanje pomoću generirane systemd jedinice, aktivirane za vašeg korisnika. <span class="pts">(5 pts)</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="note">
    <span class="en">Reboot to verify persistence: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code>, then reconnect and run <code>grade t10</code>.</span>
    <span class="hr">Restartajte za provjeru trajnosti: <code>sudo systemctl reboot</code>, zatim se povežite i pokrenite <code>grade t10</code>.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hint-box">
    <strong class="en">Hint</strong><strong class="hr">Savjet</strong>
    <code>podman build -t practice-web:1.0 ~/webapp/</code><br>
    <code>podman run -d --name practice-srv -p 8180:8080 practice-web:1.0</code><br>
    <span class="en">Persist with a systemd unit:</span><span class="hr">Trajnost putem systemd jedinice:</span><br>
    <code>podman generate systemd --new --files --name practice-srv</code><br>
    <code>mkdir -p ~/.config/systemd/user/</code><br>
    <code>mv container-practice-srv.service ~/.config/systemd/user/</code><br>
    <code>systemctl --user daemon-reload &amp;&amp; systemctl --user enable --now container-practice-srv</code>
  </div>
</div>

